{"type":"notify","delay":1300,"fromId":"lena","fromName":"{{name:lena}}","avatar":"assets/avatars/lena.jpg","text":"Morning ❤️ Is my hair tie still safe, or has your sofa claimed it?","target":"conversation"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"It's next to my keys"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"You lose those too 😭"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"I'll put a guard on it"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"Thank you, it deserves proper treatment"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"Did you sleep well?"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"Yeah, better than the night before"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"I could've stayed under that blanket another hour though"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"You nearly did"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"It was comfortable, and I liked the company ❤️"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"The cushion is very charming"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"I was talking about you, idiot"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"I'll take the compliment"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"Good, I don't have time to explain another one 😌"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"Busy morning?"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"Class first, then work. I'm just getting ready"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"With your hair down today?"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"Unless your guard is also delivering the hair tie"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"He only works on site"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"Terrible service"},
{"type":"image","delay":1200,"from":"lena","image":"assets/pictures/Conversation/lena_day19_morning_ntr.jpg"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"There, ready without it 😊"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"You look lovely"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"Thank you handsome ❤️ What are you doing today?"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"Laundry, then I want to finish that game I started"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"Hang the washing up before you start playing"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"I know"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"I'd rather hear about your game than a machine full of damp clothes 😭"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"I'll get it done first"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"I'm choosing to believe you"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"Are you working late?"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"I should finish at five again, then straight home"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"Have a good day"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"You too. I'd rather still be on your sofa, but the bus won't wait for me"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"I'll keep your seat"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"lena","text":"And my hair tie 😌 Love you"},
{"type":"message","delay":900,"from":"player","text":"Love you too"}
